OL,13,     Fstrange figure by the Clyde.
OL,14,     FWritten by Liam McIlvanney.
OL,15,G0000 Midnight News
OL,16,G0015 Crossing Continents
OL,17,     FWhat do you do if your first
OL,18,     Flanguage also belongs to your
OL,19,     Fcountry's enemy? The battle within
OL,20,     FUkraine over use of Russian, which
OL,21,     Fis increasingly restricted by law.
